OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy on Sunday with a
OL,6,Fstrengthening breeze. Outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain will continue through the day,
OL,8,Fturning heavy and blustery at times,
OL,9,Fparticularly into the afternoon. A
OL,10,Fmild day despite the cloud and breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain clear to the east this
OL,13,Fevening to leave a brighter end to the
OL,14,Fday. Turning chilly overnight under
OL,15,Fclear skies and lighter winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA dry day on Monday with light
OL,18,Fwinds and prolonged spells of
OL,19,Fsunshine. Chilly at first, but warm in
OL,20,Fthe afternoon. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,21,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
