OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FLargely dry, cloudy, warm and breezy
OL,7,Fon Tuesday with rain arriving later.
OL,8,FRain clearing by Wednesday and
OL,9,FThursday to leave sunshine and showers
OL,10,Fwith a keen breeze.
